### map4

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl map4 f l1 l2 l3 l4 =\n    inl rec 루프 l1 l2 l3 l4 acc =\n        match l1, l2, l3, l4 with\n        | (x1 :: xs1), (x2 :: xs2), (x3 :: xs3), (x4 :: xs4) =>\n            루프 xs1 xs2 xs3 xs4 (f x1 x2 x3 x4 :: acc)\n        | _ => acc |> listm.rev\n    루프 l1 l2 l3 l4 []","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl map4 f l1 l2 l3 l4 =
      inl rec 루프 l1 l2 l3 l4 acc =
          match l1, l2, l3, l4 with
          | (x1 :: xs1), (x2 :: xs2), (x3 :: xs3), (x4 :: xs4) =>
              루프 xs1 xs2 xs3 xs4 (f x1 x2 x3 x4 :: acc)
          | _ => acc |> listm.rev
      루프 l1 l2 l3 l4 []
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

