### choose

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl choose f l =\n    (l, [])\n    ||> listm.foldBack fun x acc =>\n        match f x with\n        | Some y => y :: acc\n        | None => acc","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl choose f l =
      (l, [])
      ||> listm.foldBack fun x acc =>
          match f x with
          | Some y => y :: acc
          | None => acc
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

