### indexed

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl indexed list =\n    (([], 0), list)\n    ||> listm.fold fun (acc, i) x =>\n        (i, x) :: acc, i + 1\n    |> fst\n    |> listm.rev","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl indexed list =
      (([], 0), list)
      ||> listm.fold fun (acc, i) x =>
          (i, x) :: acc, i + 1
      |> fst
      |> listm.rev
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

