### group_by

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl group_by fn list =\n    (list, [])\n    ||> listm.foldBack fun x acc =>\n        inl xk = fn x\n        inl found, new_acc =\n            ((false, []), acc)\n            ||> listm.fold fun (found, acc') (k, xs) =>\n                if k = xk\n                then true, (k, x :: xs) :: acc'\n                else found, (k, xs) :: acc'\n        if found\n        then new_acc\n        else (xk, [ x ]) :: new_acc","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl group_by fn list =
      (list, [])
      ||> listm.foldBack fun x acc =>
          inl xk = fn x
          inl found, new_acc =
              ((false, []), acc)
              ||> listm.fold fun (found, acc') (k, xs) =>
                  if k = xk
                  then true, (k, x :: xs) :: acc'
                  else found, (k, xs) :: acc'
          if found
          then new_acc
          else (xk, [ x ]) :: new_acc
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

