### try_pick

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl try_pick fn list =\n    inl rec body fn = function\n        | [] => None\n        | x :: xs =>\n            match fn x with\n            | Some y => Some y\n            | None => 루프 xs\n    and inl 루프 list =\n        if var_is list |> not\n        then body fn list\n        else\n            inl fn = join fn\n            inl list = dyn list\n            join body fn list\n    루프 list","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl try_pick fn list =
      inl rec body fn = function
          | [] => None
          | x :: xs =>
              match fn x with
              | Some y => Some y
              | None => 루프 xs
      and inl 루프 list =
          if var_is list |> not
          then body fn list
          else
              inl fn = join fn
              inl list = dyn list
              join body fn list
      루프 list
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

