### box

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl box forall t. (list : list t) : list' t =\n    run_target function\n        | Rust => fun () =>\n            // One Vec filled front to back (cons' copies the whole Vec per element: quadratic on Rust).\n            inl acc : $'Rc<RefCell<Vec<`t>>>' = $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(Vec::new()))'\n            inl _ : i32 = (0i32, list) ||> listm.fold fun n (x : t) =>\n                $'!acc.borrow_mut().push(!x)' : ()\n                n + 1\n            $'Rc::new(!acc.borrow().clone())' : list' t\n        | _ => fun () => (list, empty' ()) ||> listm.foldBack cons'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl box forall t. (list : list t) : list' t =
      run_target function
          | Rust => fun () =>
              // One Vec filled front to back (cons' copies the whole Vec per element: quadratic on Rust).
              inl acc : $'Rc<RefCell<Vec<`t>>>' = $'Rc::new(RefCell::new(Vec::new()))'
              inl _ : i32 = (0i32, list) ||> listm.fold fun n (x : t) =>
                  $'!acc.borrow_mut().push(!x)' : ()
                  n + 1
              $'Rc::new(!acc.borrow().clone())' : list' t
          | _ => fun () => (list, empty' ()) ||> listm.foldBack cons'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

